se-us,\n            .faq-section {\n                width: calc(100% - 32px);\n                margin-left: auto;\n                margin-right: auto;\n                box-sizing: border-box;\n            }\n            .gallery-card {\n                width: 280px;\n            }\n            .gallery-img-wrap {\n                height: 200px;\n            }\n            .gallery-carousel-group {\n                gap: 18px;\n                padding-right: 18px;\n            }\n            .gallery-carousel-track {\n                animation-duration: 22s;\n            }\n            .closing-section {\n                width: calc(100% - 32px);\n                margin-left: auto;\n                margin-right: auto;\n                box-sizing: border-box;\n                padding: 25px 16px;\n                border-radius: 16px;\n            }\n            .process-card-row {\n                flex-direction: column;\n            }\n        }\n\n        @media (min-width: 481px) and (max-width: 767px) {\n            .intro-text,\n            .philosophy-box,\n            .services-grid,\n            .why-choose-us,\n            .faq-section,\n            .closing-section {\n                width: calc(100% - 40px);\n            }\n        }\n    </style>\n\n\n    \n    <!-- HERO SECTION -->\n    <section class=\"hero-section\">\n        <div class=\"container\">\n            <h1>Luxury Home Interior Designs in Noida</h1>\n        </div>\n    </section>\n\n    <!-- MAIN CONTENT WRAPPER -->\n    <div class=\"container content-wrap\">\n\n        <!-- INTRO -->\n        <div class=\"intro-text\">\n            \n            <h2>Luxury Home Interior Designs for Elegant and Comfortable Living</h2>\n            <p>A luxury home is not simply expensive furniture and decoration; it is a setting that makes you feel relaxed and comfortable. <b>Luxury Home Interior Designs in Noida</b>&nbsp;focus on bringing elegance, comfort, personal taste, and daily needs together. We design each part of the space carefully, so every room feels complete without losing its practical side.</p>\n        </div>\n\n        <!-- PHILOSOPHY / SERVICE OVERVIEW -->\n        <div class=\"philosophy-box\">\n            <h2>High-End Interior Design Services for Refined and Comfortable Homes</h2>\n            <p>With luxury home interior designs, each house has its own character, and the interior should reflect it. You may already have a clear idea of the colors, furniture, surfaces, lighting, or overall look you want. We work around these choices and shape them into a complete design. Every area gets attention based on how you want to use it.</p>\n            <p>Our <b>high-end interior design services in Noida</b> are planned for people who desire a refined and comfortable home, without making it overly complicated. The living room can feel welcoming, the master bedroom can offer a quiet, private retreat, and the formal areas can be ready for entertaining guests.</p>\n        </div>\n\n        <!-- SERVICES GRID -->\n        <div class=\"services-grid\">\n            <div class=\"service-card\">\n                <h3>Materials That Add Beauty And Value</h3>\n                <p>Material selection has an important role in luxury home interior designs. We choose finishes, surfaces, furniture details, and other elements according to the design plan. Custom furniture can create a personal look while using space well.</p><p>Our <b>luxurious interior design in Noida</b>&nbsp;takes into account the small details that change the whole feel of a room. Colours, textures, lighting, furnishings and surfaces are chosen carefully to create a well-planned, comfortable space.</p>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"service-card\">\n                <h3>Layouts Made For Easy Living</h3>\n                <p>In luxury home interior designs, a well-planned layout makes the home open and easy to use. Furniture should have enough space around it, walkways should stay clear, and each area should have a well-defined purpose. We plan layouts with these daily needs in mind while keeping the home stylish.</p><p>As a <b>modern home interior designer in Noida</b>, we can create layouts that make better use of the available space. Large spaces can be divided into useful zones without feeling overcrowded. Smaller areas can also be planned carefully so they remain comfortable.</p>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"service-card full-width\">\n                <h3>Design That Reflects Your Personality</h3>\n                <p>Your home should feel like your own. That is why personalised planning matters. We consider your lifestyle, taste, colours, comfort needs, and ideas.</p><p>As a <b>luxury home interior designer in Noida</b>, our focus is on creating spaces that feel personal rather than following one fixed style. Some people prefer a simple setting, while others enjoy richer details. We adapt the design to match those preferences. <b>Luxury Home Interior Designs in Noida</b>&nbsp;can also be shaped around your personal choices.</p>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"service-card full-width\">\n                <h3>Why Choose Our Interior Design Approach?</h3>\n                <p>Our luxury home interior designs combine the finest residential planning, personal consultations, and full-scale project execution into one. Our goal is to ensure the process remains transparent throughout the entire journey. We concentrate on interiors that are attractive, functional, and fit for the residents.</p>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n\n\n        <!-- FAQS -->\n        <section class=\"faq-section\">\n            <h2>Frequently Asked Questions</h2>\n            <div class=\"faq-list\">\n                <div class=\"faq-item\">\n                    <h3 class=\"faq-q\">What makes a luxury home interior different?</h3>\n                    <p class=\"faq-a\"><b>Luxury interiors</b>&nbsp;involve good planning, superior finishings, personal touches, comfort, and a design that complements the owner&rsquo;s preference.</p>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"faq-item\">\n                    <h3 class=\"faq-q\">Can the design be personalized?</h3>\n                    <p class=\"faq-a\">Absolutely! You can plan it keeping your lifestyle, taste, favourite colors, furniture and use of the rooms in mind.</p>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"faq-item\">\n                    <h3 class=\"faq-q\">Do you design only large homes?</h3>\n                    <p class=\"faq-a\">No. With good planning, luxury home interior designs in Noida can make both large and smaller homes feel comfortable, stylish, and well organised.</p>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"faq-item\">\n                    <h3 class=\"faq-q\">What other interior design solutions are available?</h3>\n                    <p class=\"faq-a\">Yes, different interior design services are available for homes, offices, and commercial spaces. You can select the services based on your design goals and space requirements.</p>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"faq-item\">\n                    <h3 class=\"faq-q\">Can you handle design and execution?</h3>\n                    <p class=\"faq-a\">Yes. Complete design and execution services can help keep the project organised from planning through completion.</p>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"learn-more-wrap\">\n                <a href=\"https://www.ninthcorner.in/noida/services.php\" class=\"learn-more-btn\">Learn More</a>\n            </div>\n        </section>\n\n        <!-- WORK DONE / PORTFOLIO SHOWCASE -->\n        <section class=\"work-gallery-section\">\n            <div class=\"gallery-header\">\n                <h2>Our Completed Projects in Noida</h2>\n                <p>Showcasing our completed residential and commercial spaces designed with excellence.</p>\n            </div>\n       